  `upstream_model_name`, `request_path`, `request_conversion`, `claude`,
  `cache_creation_*`, `usage_semantic`).
  Original `InjectTieredBillingInfo` public log JSON also includes
  `image_count` / `fixed_price` / `request_rules` from
  `billingexpr.ComputeTieredQuotaWithRequest` (and estimated_* fallback when
  settlement result is nil). `tier("image", fixed(0.04)) * image_count` with
  3 images is quota `60000` (`QuotaPerUnit` 500000). OpenAI image `n` is
  original `ImageRequest.ImageCount` (Ali uses `parameters.n`); settlement
