  HTTP PostAudio uses original
  `calculateAudioQuota` (`QuotaFromDecimal`, details text/audio tokens,
  map `GetCompletionRatio` / `GetAudioRatio` / `GetAudioCompletionRatio`,
  zero `TotalTokens` unless fixed-price).
  Original `service.attachQuotaSaturation` nests
  `admin_info.quota_saturation` (`op`, `kind`, `original`, `clamped`) on
  text/audio/WSS consume logs so `formatUserLogs` strips it. `TryTieredSettle`
